    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SEASON 3 OF THE CROWN&quot;" target="&quot;AUGUST&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A teaser trailer for the third season was released in August, indicating promotional activities before the premiere."</data>
