    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SEASON 3 OF THE CROWN&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENT 3&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Document 3 mentions the premiere of the third season of The Crown on November 17, 2014, indicating an earlier date for the same event."</data>
