    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT 1&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENT 2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Both Document 1 and Document 2 refer to the same event of the third season premiere on November 17, 2019."</data>
      <data key="d5">"correlation, reference"</data>
      <data key="d6">rgb-0055</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT 1&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENT 3&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Document 1 and Document 3 both mention the premiere of the third season of The Crown, but on different dates (2019 vs. 2014), indicating a discrepancy in the information provided."</data>
